# Rasaoi Context Guard

## Before Any Code Change

1. Read `.cursor/CONTEXT_PLAN.md`
2. If touching `src/**` — also read `src/CURSOR.md`
3. If touching `supabase/**` — also read `supabase/CURSOR.md`

## Verify Before Inventing

If a file, API endpoint, table, or module is not listed in CONTEXT_PLAN, **search the repo first**. Do not assume it exists.

## Sync Pairs (Must Update Together)

- `src/lib/dietary.ts` ↔ `supabase/functions/_shared/dietary.ts`
- `src/lib/intentSanitize.ts` ↔ `supabase/functions/_shared/intent-sanitize.ts`
- `src/testing/mock-places.json` ↔ `supabase/functions/places-search/fixtures/mock-places.json`
- `WELLNESS_TAG_SLUGS` in `src/lib/veda.ts` ↔ `parse-intent` output slugs

## After Architectural Changes

Update CONTEXT_PLAN header (`last_verified_commit`, affected sections) and the relevant CURSOR.md in the same commit.

## Regression

Run `npm test` when changing `src/lib/` scoring, dietary, or pairings logic.

## Hallucination & speculation guard

Read `.cursor/rules/hallucination-guard.mdc` when touching intent, pairings, scoring, culinary data, nutrition, or experimental AI paths. Impact doc: `docs/ROE-016-hallucination-guard-impact-analysis.md`.

## Experimental sandbox (ROE-016)

- Code under `src/lib/experimental/`, `scripts/experimental/`, `supabase/migrations_experimental/` is **sandboxed** from production.
- Staging path: dedicated Vercel project **https://rasaoi-i8.vercel.app** + Supabase `aotlzhdgnvovvqxmgyyx` — `docs/experimental/STAGING_PREVIEW_SETUP.md` (Docker optional / unused).
- Edge AI uses `_shared/model-router.ts` with **Gemini fallback**; non-Gemini providers only when staging secrets + `EXPERIMENTAL_MODEL_ROUTER=true`.
- Never apply experimental migrations with `supabase db push` to production.
- Never point experimental writes at prod project `kiugplotjcnmpwjlxajc`.
- Secrets: `.env.experimental` only (gitignored).
- Adversarial sim gate: `npm run experimental:sim` — **PASS** on 520 seeds @ 100% heuristic (2026-07-31). Heuristic gate ≠ live LLM parse gate.
- Apify weekly cron (`docs/experimental/APIFY_CLI_CRON_SETUP.md`) upserts **`experimental_dish_knowledge` only** — never auto-write live `menu_items` without explicit `--promote-menu-items --promote-commit`.
- Develop merge still locked until **formal plate soak** + stakeholder approval (`docs/ROE-016-hallucination-guard-impact-analysis.md`).
